# Cypress Cucumber POC – QA Playground SecureBank

## Project Overview
This POC demonstrates a UI automation framework built using Cypress, JavaScript, and Cucumber by following the Page Object Model (POM).

The objective of this POC is to demonstrate the implementation of a UI Automation Framework capable of executing:
• Functional Tests
• Smoke Tests
• Regression Tests
• End-to-End (E2E) Tests
using the SecureBank Demo Application available in QA Playground.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tech Stack
| Technology | Version |
|------------|----------|
| Cypress | 15.18.0 |
| JavaScript | ES6 |
| Cucumber BDD | @badeball/cypress-cucumber-preprocessor |
| NodeJS | 24.x |
| Mochawesome | Latest |
| ESBuild | Latest |

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Framework Architecture
The framework follows the **Page Object Model (POM)** design pattern.
Feature File
        │
        ▼
Step Definition
        │
        ▼
Page Object
        │
        ▼
Application Under Test.

Business logic is implemented inside **Page Objects**, while **Step Definitions** remain lightweight and reusable.

