# Framework Design
The framework is designed using:
- Page Object Model
- Reusable Components
- Data Driven Testing
- Cucumber BDD
- Clean Separation of Business Logic
- Reusable Step Definitions
- Fixtures for Test Data
- Hooks for Test Lifecycle Management

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test Suites

## Functional Test Suite
Purpose: Validates individual application modules.
Covered Modules:
- Home
- Demo Apps
- Secure Bank Login
- Dashboard
- Transfer Money
- Login Validation
- Account Validation
- Role Validation

## Smoke Suite
Purpose: Validate the critical application functionality after every deployment.
Execution Tag: @smoke
Flow:
    QA Playground
        ↓
    Demo Apps
        ↓
    Secure Bank
        ↓
    Login
        ↓
    Dashboard
        ↓
    Transfer Money
        ↓
    Transfer Successful

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Regression Suite
Purpose: Validate the complete business flow for multiple user roles.
Covered Users : Standard User & Admin User
Execution Tag: @regression
Uses
- Scenario Outline
- Examples Table
- Data Driven Testing

Flow:
    Login
     ↓
    Dashboard
     ↓
    Transfer
     ↓
    Transfer Successful
     ↓
    Dashboard
     ↓
    Logout

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## End-to-End Suite
Purpose: Validate the complete customer journey.
Execution Tag: @e2e
Flow:
    QA Playground
      ↓
    Demo Apps
      ↓
    Secure Bank
      ↓
    Login
      ↓
    Dashboard
      ↓
    Transfer
      ↓
    Transfer Successful
      ↓
    Dashboard
      ↓
    Logout

