# Exception Handling
The framework ignores the known React rendering issue thrown by QA Playground.
```javascript
Cypress.on("uncaught:exception", (err) => {
    if (err.message.includes("Minified React error #418")) {
        return false;
    }
});
```
This exception belongs to the application and should not fail the automation execution.

# Reporting
Framework uses **Mochawesome Reporter**. The framework uses Mochawesome Reporter to generate HTML and JSON execution reports.

Generated Report Location
```
mochawesome-report/
```
