# Execution Commands
## Install Dependencies
```bash
npm install
```

## Open Cypress
```bash
npm run cy:open
```
## Run All Tests
```bash
npm run all
```

## Run Smoke Suite
```bash
npm run smoke
```
## Run Regression Suite
```bash
npm run regression
```

## Run End-to-End Suite
```bash
npm run e2e
```

## Generate Mochawesome Report
```bash
npm run report
```
## Generate Test Report
```bash
npm run test:report
```